   "text": {
    "L1": "A growing shape pattern changes from one step to the next.",
    "L2": "Do not guess the next term. Find the change and check that it stays the same.",
    "L3": "One matchstick house needs 5 sticks. A second house adds only 4 because one wall is shared.",
    "L4": "So the pattern is 5, 9, 13. Four sticks are added for each new house.",
    "L5": "To find a far step, keep the starting 5 and add 4 for every extra house.",
    "L6": "Ten houses need 5 plus 9 times 4, which is 41 sticks.",
    "L7": "It is not 50, because shared walls mean each new house does not need 5 new sticks.",
    "L8": "Now check the rule: how many sticks are needed for four houses?"
   },
